                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Each cell holds two swatches: the left one is the light branch, the right one the dark branch. common / occasional / rare are neutral contexts named after how often they are used (not primary/secondary/tertiary); brand = blue, positive = green, negative = red. background is the context fill, text and icon share the same value (icon needs 3:1, text 4.5:1), border is a functional boundary ≥3:1, divider is a quiet separation and always stays below border.",
