                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "PEN cannot compose an opaque palette color and a separate opacity token into a single color value. These variables are therefore a PEN-only exception: literal #RRGGBBAA is allowed here and the theme is stored directly in the variable. There are no aliases from ds/palette/* into this namespace, and it is not part of the semantic API.",
