              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Every glyph in the document is an icon node of the lucide library — 17 distinct names in 158 placements across the ALT3 screens and the design-system boards (counts exclude the display glyphs of this catalog itself). The node box is the glyph size, the glyph is scaled to it, and the colour always comes from a token: feature rows paint glyphs with the background projection of a step, filled buttons with the content colour, accents with the blue palette. The catalog tiles below are drawn in $ds/semantic/common/50/text; the token each icon actually uses is listed in \"Stage — icon colour usage\".",
